   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Restyle any video\n\nLoad a clip you already rendered (MiniMax H3, LTX, Seedance, live action) and give it the Deforum / AnimateDiff / Disco look: an image model re-paints every frame, with the previous painted frame carried along the clip's own motion.\n\n- `style`: deforum morph, animatediff boil, disco flicker, clean restyle, custom.\n- With **Structure** on (depth ControlNet) `denoise` 0.6-0.8 re-imagines the texture and keeps the shapes; without it stay under 0.5.\n- For the real AnimateDiff look (motion module), use template 14.\n- The audio and fps of the source are kept. **Upscale 2K** on a switch."
   ]
  },
